---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Playground
description: Write Python and see the WebAssembly Waspy compiles it to, live in your browser. Run the exported functions right there.
permalink: /playground/
wide: true
hideFooter: true
# A tool page: no background critters walking behind the editor.
critters: false
bodyClass: pg-page
scripts: ["/playground/playground.js"]
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<style>
    /* Page-specific CSS the utilities can't express. Colors are the design
       system's custom properties, so both themes follow the site switch. */

    /* Pane heights: stacked below lg, a full-height two-pane tool above. */
    .pg-workspace { --split: 50%; }
    .pg-pane { height: 74dvh; min-height: 440px; }
    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .pg-workspace { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, var(--split)) 14px minmax(0, 1fr); }
        .pg-pane { height: auto; min-height: 0; }
    }

    body.pg-resizing { cursor: col-resize; user-select: none; }

    /* Example picker */
    .pg-select select option { background: var(--c-bg-1); color: var(--c-ink); }

    /* Output states */
    #output:not(.ready) .pg-view { visibility: hidden; }
    #output.stale .pg-view { opacity: 0.4; filter: saturate(0.6); }
    .pg-view { transition: opacity 0.25s ease, filter 0.25s ease; }
    .pg-view[hidden], .pg-state[hidden], #errorPanel[hidden] { display: none; }

    .pg-hive span {
        width: 22px;
        height: 25px;
        clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0 75%, 0 25%);
        background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--c-honey), var(--c-amber) 55%, var(--c-ember));
        animation: pg-buzz 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .pg-hive span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    .pg-hive span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    @keyframes pg-buzz {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 0.25; transform: translateY(0) scale(0.85); }
        50% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1); }
    }

    #loadProgress { transition: width 0.2s ease; }
    #loadProgress.indeterminate { width: 35% !important; animation: pg-slide 1.1s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes pg-slide {
        from { transform: translateX(-100%); }
        to { transform: translateX(290%); }
    }

    #errorPanel { animation: pg-in 0.3s ease; }
    .pg-log { animation: pg-in 0.25s ease; }
    .pg-log + .pg-log { border-top: 1px dashed var(--c-line); }
    .pg-log-call::before { content: ">>> "; color: var(--c-amber); }
    @keyframes pg-in {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }

    /* Binary view: the section bar, its legend and the hex dump. Each
       segment and byte run carries its section's color in --sec. */
    #sectionBar > * { min-width: 3px; background: var(--sec); transition: opacity 0.2s ease; cursor: pointer; }
    #sectionBar:hover > * { opacity: 0.45; }
    #sectionBar > *:hover { opacity: 1; }
    #sectionLegend button {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--c-ink-1);
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }
    #sectionLegend button:hover { color: var(--c-ink); }
    #sectionLegend i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--sec); }
    #sectionLegend em { font-style: normal; color: var(--c-ink-2); }
    #hexDump .off { color: var(--c-ink-2); opacity: 0.75; user-select: none; }
    #hexDump .off.flash { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-amber) 30%, transparent); opacity: 1; border-radius: 3px; }
    #hexDump .off { transition: background 1.2s ease; }
    #hexDump .asc { color: var(--c-ink-2); }
    #hexDump .b { color: var(--sec); }

    /* Run view arguments */
    .pg-input {
        padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
        border-radius: 7px;
        border: 1px solid var(--c-line-strong);
        background: var(--c-bg-1);
        color: var(--c-ink);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .pg-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--c-amber); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-amber) 20%, transparent); }
    .pg-input[aria-invalid="true"] { border-color: var(--c-red); }
    .pg-input:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
</style>

<div class="shell-wide flex flex-col gap-3 pt-2 pb-4 lg:h-[calc(100dvh-4rem)] lg:min-h-[620px]">

    {# Toolbar #}
    <section class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-8 gap-y-3" aria-label="Playground controls">
        <div class="min-w-0">
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-[1.75rem]">Play<span class="text-gradient">ground</span></h1>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-1">Python in, WebAssembly out, compiled right in your browser.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex w-full flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:w-auto">
            <label class="pg-select relative flex min-w-0 flex-[1_1_100%] items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface py-1 pr-1 pl-3 transition focus-within:border-amber/60 hover:border-line-strong sm:flex-none">
                <span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-2 uppercase">Example</span>
                <select id="exampleSelect" class="min-w-0 flex-1 cursor-pointer appearance-none bg-transparent py-1 pr-7 pl-1 text-sm font-semibold text-ink outline-none"></select>
                <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute right-3 size-2.5 text-amber" viewBox="0 0 10 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 1l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
            </label>

            {% for t in [
                { id: "optimizeToggle", label: "Optimize", title: "Run the Binaryen optimizer over the output", checked: false },
                { id: "autoToggle", label: "Auto", title: "Recompile as you type", checked: true }
            ] %}
            <label class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-1 transition select-none hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink has-checked:text-ink" title="{{ t.title }}">
                <input type="checkbox" role="switch" id="{{ t.id }}" class="peer sr-only" {% if t.checked %}checked{% endif %}>
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-4 w-7 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-ink-2/35 transition peer-checked:bg-linear-to-r peer-checked:from-honey peer-checked:to-ember peer-focus-visible:outline-2 peer-focus-visible:outline-offset-2 peer-focus-visible:outline-amber after:absolute after:top-0.5 after:left-0.5 after:size-3 after:rounded-full after:bg-ink after:transition-transform after:duration-300 peer-checked:after:translate-x-3 peer-checked:after:bg-on-accent"></span>
                {{ t.label }}
            </label>
            {% endfor %}

            <button type="button" id="shareBtn" class="btn-ghost btn-sm h-[38px] rounded-xl! data-copied:border-green/40 data-copied:text-green" title="Copy a link to this program" aria-label="Copy a link to this program">
                <svg class="size-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg>
                <span id="shareLabel" class="hidden sm:inline" aria-live="polite">Share</span>
            </button>

            <button type="button" id="compileBtn" class="btn-primary btn-sm ml-auto h-[38px] flex-1 rounded-xl! sm:ml-0 sm:flex-none disabled:hover:translate-y-0 disabled:hover:brightness-100" disabled>
                <svg class="size-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.14v13.72a1 1 0 0 0 1.5.86l11-6.86a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.72l-11-6.86A1 1 0 0 0 8 5.14z"/></svg>
                Compile
                <kbd id="compileKbd" class="ml-0.5 hidden rounded-md bg-on-accent/15 px-1.5 py-px font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-medium sm:inline">Ctrl ↵</kbd>
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    {# Workspace #}
    <section id="workspace" class="pg-workspace flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 lg:grid lg:gap-0" aria-label="Workspace">

        {# Source pane #}
        <div class="pg-pane glass-strong flex min-w-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" role="region" aria-label="Python source">
            <div class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 border-b border-line pr-2 pl-4">
                <div class="hidden gap-1.5 sm:flex" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-ember/80"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber/80"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green/80"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 self-stretch">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 border-amber px-3 font-mono text-[0.8rem] font-medium text-honey">
                        <span class="rounded bg-teal/15 px-1.5 py-px text-[0.6rem] font-semibold tracking-wide text-teal">PY</span>main.py
                    </span>
                </div>
                <button type="button" id="resetBtn" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-lg text-ink-2 transition hover:bg-amber/12 hover:text-ink" title="Reset to the selected example" aria-label="Reset to the selected example">
                    <svg class="size-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div id="editor" class="relative min-h-0 flex-1 bg-code/40">
                <p class="p-5 font-mono text-sm text-ink-2">Loading the editor…</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 overflow-hidden border-t border-line px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-[0.72rem] whitespace-nowrap text-ink-2">
                <span id="cursorPos" aria-live="off">Ln 1, Col 1</span>
                <span class="flex-1"></span>
                <span>Python</span>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline">Spaces: 4</span>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline">UTF-8</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="gutter" class="relative hidden cursor-col-resize touch-none outline-none lg:block after:absolute after:top-1/2 after:left-1/2 after:h-11 after:w-1 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:-translate-y-1/2 after:rounded-full after:bg-line-strong after:transition-all hover:after:h-18 hover:after:bg-amber focus-visible:after:h-18 focus-visible:after:bg-amber data-dragging:after:h-18 data-dragging:after:bg-amber"
             role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical" aria-label="Resize panes" aria-controls="workspace" aria-valuemin="20" aria-valuemax="80" aria-valuenow="50" tabindex="0" title="Drag to resize, double-click to reset"></div>

        {# Output pane #}
        <div class="pg-pane glass-strong flex min-w-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" role="region" aria-label="Generated WebAssembly">
            <div class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 border-b border-line pr-1.5 pl-2 sm:gap-3 sm:pr-2 sm:pl-4">
                <div class="hidden gap-1.5 sm:flex" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-ember/80"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber/80"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-green/80"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 self-stretch overflow-x-auto [scrollbar-width:none]" role="tablist" aria-label="Output views">
                    {% for tab in [
                        { view: "wat", panel: "view-wat", badge: "WAT", label: "Text", tone: "bg-amber/15 text-amber" },
                        { view: "binary", panel: "viewBinary", badge: "01", label: "Binary", tone: "bg-ember/15 text-ember" },
                        { view: "run", panel: "viewRun", badge: "▶", label: "Run", tone: "bg-green/15 text-green" }
                    ] %}
                    <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-{{ tab.view }}" data-view="{{ tab.view }}" aria-controls="{{ tab.panel }}" aria-selected="{{ 'true' if loop.first else 'false' }}" tabindex="{{ 0 if loop.first else -1 }}"
                            class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 border-transparent px-2 font-mono sm:gap-2 sm:px-3 text-[0.8rem] font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-ink-2 transition hover:text-ink-1 focus-visible:rounded-md focus-visible:outline-offset-[-4px] aria-selected:border-amber aria-selected:text-honey">
                        <span class="rounded px-1.5 py-px text-[0.6rem] font-semibold tracking-wide {{ tab.tone }}">{{ tab.badge }}</span>{{ tab.label }}
                    </button>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-0.5">
                    <button type="button" id="copyBtn" class="group/copy grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-lg text-ink-2 transition hover:bg-amber/12 hover:text-ink disabled:cursor-default disabled:opacity-35 disabled:hover:bg-transparent disabled:hover:text-ink-2 data-copied:text-green" title="Copy the WebAssembly text" aria-label="Copy the WebAssembly text" disabled>
                        <span class="group-data-copied/copy:hidden">{{ icon("copy", "size-4") }}</span>
                        <span class="hidden group-data-copied/copy:inline">{{ icon("check", "size-4") }}</span>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" id="downloadBtn" class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-lg text-ink-2 transition hover:bg-amber/12 hover:text-ink disabled:cursor-default disabled:opacity-35 disabled:hover:bg-transparent disabled:hover:text-ink-2" title="Download main.wasm" aria-label="Download main.wasm" disabled>
                        {{ icon("download", "size-4") }}
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="output" class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col">
                {# Loading the compiler #}
                <div id="stateLoading" class="pg-state absolute inset-0 z-[2] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-surface-strong p-8 text-center" role="status">
                    <div class="pg-hive flex gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
                    <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">Loading the compiler</h2>
                    <p class="max-w-sm text-sm text-ink-1">Waspy itself, built to WebAssembly. It downloads once and then compiles locally.</p>
                    <div class="mt-3 h-1 w-56 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-amber/15" role="progressbar" aria-label="Compiler download">
                        <div id="loadProgress" class="h-full w-0 rounded-full bg-linear-to-r from-honey to-ember"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                {# The compiler could not load #}
                <div id="stateUnavailable" class="pg-state absolute inset-0 z-[2] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-surface-strong p-8 text-center" role="alert" hidden>
                    <div class="hex grid size-14 place-items-center bg-red/15 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-red" aria-hidden="true">!</div>
                    <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">The compiler didn't load</h2>
                    <p id="unavailableMsg" class="max-w-sm text-sm text-ink-1">The in-browser build of Waspy could not be fetched.</p>
                    <button type="button" id="retryBtn" class="btn-ghost btn-sm mt-2">Try again</button>
                </div>

                {# Compile errors #}
                <div id="errorPanel" class="mx-3 mt-3 max-h-[45%] shrink-0 overflow-auto rounded-xl border border-red/40 bg-red/8 px-4 py-3 scrollbar-thin" role="alert" hidden>
                    <div class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
                        <span id="errorBadge" class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] text-red uppercase">Compile error</span>
                        <span id="errorNote" class="text-xs text-ink-2"></span>
                    </div>
                    <ul id="errorList" class="grid gap-2"></ul>
                </div>

                {# Views #}
                <div id="view-wat" class="pg-view flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col" data-view="wat" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-wat">
                    <div id="viewWat" class="min-h-0 flex-1"></div>
                </div>

                <div id="viewBinary" class="pg-view min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-auto scrollbar-thin" data-view="binary" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-binary" tabindex="0" hidden>
                    <div id="sections" class="sticky top-0 z-[1] border-b border-line bg-surface-strong px-4 pt-3.5 pb-3 backdrop-blur-md">
                        <div id="sectionBar" class="flex h-2.5 gap-0.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                        <ul id="sectionLegend" class="mt-2.5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3.5 gap-y-1" aria-label="Module sections"></ul>
                    </div>
                    <pre id="hexDump" class="m-0 px-4 pt-3 pb-5 font-mono text-[0.76rem] leading-[1.75] text-ink"></pre>
                </div>

                <div id="viewRun" class="pg-view flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col" data-view="run" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-run" hidden>
                    <div id="runList" class="grid min-h-0 flex-1 content-start gap-2.5 overflow-auto p-3 scrollbar-thin"></div>
                    <div class="flex h-[38%] min-h-36 shrink-0 flex-col border-t border-line bg-code/40">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5">
                            <span class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-2 uppercase">Console</span>
                            <button type="button" id="clearConsole" class="rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-ink-2 transition hover:bg-amber/10 hover:text-amber">Clear</button>
                        </div>
                        <div id="console" class="min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-auto px-4 pb-3 font-mono text-[0.8rem] leading-[1.7] scrollbar-thin" aria-live="polite">
                            <p id="consoleEmpty" class="font-sans text-sm text-ink-2">Call an exported function to see what it returns.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 overflow-hidden border-t border-line px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-[0.72rem] whitespace-nowrap text-ink-2">
                <span id="status" data-state="loading" class="group/status inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2 text-ink-1" role="status">
                    <span class="size-[7px] shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current text-ink-2 shadow-[0_0_8px_currentColor] group-data-[state=ok]/status:text-green group-data-[state=error]/status:text-red group-data-[state=busy]/status:animate-pulse group-data-[state=busy]/status:text-amber group-data-[state=loading]/status:animate-pulse group-data-[state=loading]/status:text-amber" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span id="statusText" class="truncate">Loading</span>
                </span>
                <span class="flex-1"></span>
                <span id="statSize"></span>
                <span id="statFuncs"></span>
                <span id="statExports" class="hidden sm:inline"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <p class="text-center text-sm text-ink-2">
        Waspy compiles a typed subset of Python, and refuses what it can't compile rather than guessing.
        See <a href="/docs/programs/" class="link">what a program looks like</a>,
        <a href="/docs/python-subset/" class="link">the Python subset</a>,
        and the <a href="/modules/" class="link">modules board</a>.
    </p>
</div>
